    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, the evil creatures residing in the dungeons constantly invaded the cat clan's homeland, seizing treasures and resources. To defend their territory and reclaim lost wealth, the brave cat warriors decide to delve into the dungeons, defeat these enemies, and restore their glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Meowbrick Dungeon</i></strong> combines the gameplay of <i>Slay the Spire</i> with the classic Falling-block puzzle game mechanics. Here, you will damage enemies and trigger various effects by clearing blocks. After defeating all the enemies in a room, you can choose one of three new blocks to add to your collection, gradually increasing your combat power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic building</strong>: Combine and arrange blocks cleverly to create powerful strategies to defeat enemies and complete the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Embark on this adventure, build your powerful block combinations, defeat all enemies in the dungeon, and reclaim the cat clan\u2019s glory and wealth!</i></p>",
